  "description": "A Love-in-Love That Begins Only After Divorce...\n\nWith My Ex-Husband!\n\nA new branch director has just been appointed. And guess what? That director... is my ex-husband!\n\nThere was a company dinner that night, but when I opened my eyes… I was in a bed.\n\nAnd the man lying next to me? \n\nMy ex-husband.\n\nI barely managed to scramble out without even dressing properly… But then he called me into his office—no, my ex-husband called me in.\n\n“Did you forget something?”\n\n“Wh-what…?”\n\nWhat he handed me… was a gift box.\n\nInside? A whole set of sexy lingerie.\n\n“From now on, wear things like this.”\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \nR19: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12039921)     \nR15: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12502508)",
